{
  "id": "MAT.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 28",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duunooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ning'ata sabaato, nea ghaghar gayeew eaweeda madeeda bea wiikajeanda, gawa Mariyayda siguura Magdalena ea Mariyaydida bea iyeenyean ghwadaah heeda sibunyiisa buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasimgeaw ng'eanyiida muuchi, ak gwashuubean malaykajeanda humng'eeda bea Ng'utamiida leabu humng'eeda amwahit ghoaraakghraakghta lagheaneedida sidukuteawa ghuuta bung'eedean ak goopteadawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheamamdaanyi ghawaar dadamandeeda nea hang'weakaaschi ea eashish ghawaar gapkeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah furiischoodigiga ghabeal muuchi nea ghaboadan ea gawuurji fuga nimeewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda malaykajeanda humng'eeda ak gwayeesha gadeemgiga, “Agooga adoabeali; ghaanali gideaba googasayi Yesuheeda heeta singoor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda hiji aba gideaba niduuteayda gidaghayi rukuteayda. Apkaani adaaha heeda heeta siyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ahalageat ak gooweayi arukusiina giinealangaaschi gideaba niduuna miyeeda, ak ghamneawa ea niisheedeawaneegwa gawa Galilaya, iyoahiti hoowa gajadaaha. Asi neabean nearukuneegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamwajaada ghabeawa heeda bung'eeda aba muuwda nea gang'weela muuchi, gwasalda ak ghoadaw giinealangaaschi iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaroonyi Yesu sea saawa ak gwayeesha, “Seayu!” Gwaneekiisa ak ghoang'waay geeshanga ak ghaghadoawan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yesu saawa, “Adoabeali! Aweayeena ak goorukusi orjoogiyya gaweay Galilaya amahita hoowa gayghwadaahan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita furiischoocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda beawa, ng'ula gwanda furiischoodisu weay mujiini heeda ashoohoodiga hees ak ghoadayda iita ng'asheega sean bunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaroonyi sea gweargwa ak gabalool, hit geataw furiischoodiga lapiyeeda saang'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeesha, “Ayeeshiina buuneeda, ‘Ghwahidu giinealangaaschi eawa nea silili ak gwajagwat.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ghwanyas iita sugoocheanda bea ng'eanyiida, gajeepaloola niny ak gajeegeandeawaneegwa shata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanda lapiyeedida amang'ata gwasinda baloolda gisirukusiinda. Gageawiit iiteaba ng'asheanji aba jeeda fuga Yahudi ea ghoah ghamneawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gabussa giinealangaaschi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay Giinealangiga atamwanagiin Galilaya nea ghoaburbuur heayeeda ghayi rukusa Yesu saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean dea ghaghadoawan, nea mwaatkwa ghamwachmwach jeesinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaan Yesu heanyaawa ak goobalool ak gwayeesha, “Sigoonan gheambalmeeda sean aba humng'eeda ea ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aweayeena ak ghoanung' ghoah eemoojiga sean giinealanga, nea goobaatiisanyi saawa aba gheawunga ASEETA was Bwaabwa, ea gea Orjeeda, ea gea Guroorooda Ghaydit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oanaala ghoang'waay ng'asheega sean eagoonyeegwa. Ang'ula aniini geendeayi sea agooga galeega sean ea gagul muudeanooda ng'eanyiida.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
